<section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Cookies and preferences</p><h1 class="t1 rise">Your website choices.</h1><p class="lede fade">How this website uses storage, and the optional choices you can make.</p><p class="doc-meta">Last updated November 2, 2026</p></div></section><section class="doc"><div class="wrap doc-grid"><div class="doc-aside"><details class="doc-toc" open><summary class="doc-aside-t">On this page</summary><nav aria-label="Page contents"><a href="#section-0">Necessary platform operation</a><a href="#section-1">Analytics and marketing</a><a href="#section-2">Make or change a choice</a><a href="#section-3">When controls are unavailable</a><a href="#section-4">Withdrawing a choice</a></nav></details><p class="doc-aside-t">More</p><nav aria-label="Legal"><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/legal{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-legal{% endif %}">All legal information</a><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}">NEVORA privacy policy</a></nav></div><div class="doc-body"><section id="section-0"><i>01</i><h2>Necessary platform operation</h2><p>Shopify may use storage and technical information to operate the website, protect it from abuse and remember privacy choices. When the AI assistant is turned on and you open it, Cloudflare Turnstile runs a short automated-use check in your browser; it is not used for advertising.</p></section><section id="section-1"><i>02</i><h2>Analytics and marketing</h2><p>Shopify, the website platform, collects visit and page-view information for analytics. Mailchimp, the email tool Velani uses for its mailing list, can receive visit information for analytics and marketing. Both are optional: turn them off in Cookie choices. Shopify’s settings may classify sharing with Mailchimp as a “sale” or “share” under some US state laws; you can opt out in Cookie choices.</p></section><section id="section-2"><i>03</i><h2>Make or change a choice</h2><p>The Cookie choices button opens the available controls. On Shopify, those controls use the Customer Privacy API where Shopify supports it. We record consent only from the choice you make.</p></section><section id="section-3"><i>04</i><h2>When controls are unavailable</h2><p>If the platform privacy service cannot be reached, your choices cannot be saved. Shopify describes its own processing in its notices, and the platform may set its own necessary cookies.</p></section><section id="section-4"><i>05</i><h2>Withdrawing a choice</h2><p>A changed choice applies from then on. It does not erase data that was already processed. Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> with a privacy question.</p></section><button class="pill line" type="button" data-cookie-open disabled>Open cookie choices</button><noscript><p class="cookie-nojs-note">Cookie controls need JavaScript. Write to support@thevelani.com about privacy choices.</p></noscript><div class="doc-end"><p class="hkick">Questions</p><p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>, or to VELANI LLC, 1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San Juan, PR 00927.</p><div class="acts"><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact{% endif %}">Contact</a></div></div></div></div></section>
